		Annotation {
		  SID			  "1990:886"
		  Name			  "A good variance to reset the filter to is the variance that corresponds to the distribution whose confid"
		  "ence interval at the prescribed confidence (99.7%) has a half-width (aka bound) that is 75% of the rated payload.\n"
